<!--
    S2458: the Motion Monitor's glyph. S2474 fixes the convention that a watch mini-program wears the
    same icon as its phone counterpart, and the name is the whole contract between the two modules -
    they share no source - so this file keeps app_v2's name rather than inventing a watch-only one.

    The tint differs on purpose: the phone resolves ?attr/colorOnSurface against a light surface, while
    the watch draws on a dark one under a possible photo scrim, so the watch's copy tints against its
    own theme attribute exactly as the module's other icons do.
-->
